  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The Scarlet Sovereignty teaches that society exists with a natural order of the strong over the weak, the predatory above the flock of prey, and the vampiric nobility ranked above all others. Entrenched in their positions of social might by centuries of generational accrual of wealth and influence, the nobility of the Covenant consider themselves natural lords of the city, and as such no longer subject to the traditional vampiric ban on entering a dwelling without position.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Membership in the Scarlet Sovereignty, Wisdom 13, must be a vampire.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You are no longer subject to the requirement of permission from an authorized person in order to enter a home or dwelling.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc121\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
